b.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106324#issuecomment-2874791154","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106324","id":2874791154,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rWdTy","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-13T01:49:04Z","updated_at":"2025-05-13T01:49:04Z","body":"I'm not sure why this is causing a memory leak.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2874791154/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2875060852","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106324#issuecomment-2875060852","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106324","id":2875060852,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rXfJ0","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-13T05:05:16Z","updated_at":"2025-05-13T08:20:26Z","body":"> Didn't we conclude that this wasn't a good option because per-pixel transparency isn't properly supported on Windows + Nvidia + Vulkan, which is by far our most frequent user setup?\r\n\r\nWe can probably force it to work, using NVAPI (which is already used for OpenGL), I'll check it. Setting \"Vulkan/Opengl present method\" to \"native\" should make transparency work with Vulkan. If it's overridable via API it can be used.\r\n\r\n> I'm not sure why this is causing a memory leak.\r\n\r\nSeems like it's existing one, not introduced by this PR, probably fixable by something like:\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/platform/linuxbsd/x11/gl_manager_x11.cpp b/platform/linuxbsd/x11/gl_manager_x11.cpp\r\nindex 41c8cd704b..151730b9a2 100644\r\n--- a/platform/linuxbsd/x11/gl_manager_x11.cpp\r\n+++ b/platform/linuxbsd/x11/gl_manager_x11.cpp\r\n@@ -137,6 +137,10 @@ Error GLManager_X11::_create_context(GLDisplay &gl_display) {\r\n                ERR_FAIL_NULL_V(fbc, ERR_UNCONFIGURED);\r\n\r\n                for (int i = 0; i < fbcount; i++) {\r\n+                       if (vi) {\r\n+                               XFree(vi);\r\n+                               vi = nullptr;\r\n+                       }\r\n                        vi = (XVisualInfo *)glXGetVisualFromFBConfig(x11_display, fbc[i]);\r\n                        if (!vi) {\r\n                                continue;\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2875060852/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2875915348","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106324#issuecomment-2875915348","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106324","id":2875915348,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ravxU","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-13T10:21:10Z","updated_at":"2025-05-13T10:21:10Z","body":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106344 should fix the transparency issue on NV + Vulkan.\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106345 should fix the leak.\r\n","author_association":"ME